# Marquee

An infinite scrolling component for showcasing logos, testimonials, or features in both horizontal and vertical orientations.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/marquee.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/marquee.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/marquee.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { Marquee } from '@/registry/marquee'

const logos = [
  { name: 'Logo 1' },
  { name: 'Logo 2' },
  { name: 'Logo 3' },
]
</script>

<template>
  <Marquee :items="logos" :speed="20">
    <template #default="{ item }">
      <div class="px-8 py-4 font-bold">{{ item.name }}</div>
    </template>
  </Marquee>
</template>
```

