### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `items` | `any[]` | `undefined` | The list of items to display. |
| `repeats` | `number` | `2` | How many times to repeat the items for smooth infinite scrolling. |
| `speed` | `number` | `30` | Animation duration in seconds. |
| `direction` | `string` | `'normal'` | Animation direction: `'normal'` or `'reverse'`. |
| `orientation` | `string` | `'horizontal'` | Scroll orientation: `'horizontal'` or `'vertical'`. |

### Slots

| Slot | Payload | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `default` | `{ item: any, index: number }` | Custom renderer for each item in the marquee. |
